": "response", "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["1080p", "10", "3:4竖屏，4K极致电影感MV画质，真实人像模式。夜幕降临的高空天台上，一位拥有精致东亚面孔、留着浓密黑色长卷发的摇滚女歌手在城市霓虹灯火下演唱。\n\n【00:00 - 00:05秒（起点对应图1）】\n镜头以图1的中景七分身切入。女歌手伫立在天台边缘，一手握着立式麦克风杆，头部微微上扬。夜风迎面吹来，她的黑发与银色短款金属皮衣下摆随风有节奏地向后飘逸，皮衣表面反射着浓郁的红蓝色渐变霓虹光影。地面的烟雾弥漫在脚下，背景是深蓝色夜空与远处的城市建筑轮廓。\n\n【00:05 - 00:10秒（推进与终点对应图2）】\n镜头以匀速平滑的方式向前推镜头（Slow Push-in），自然过渡至图2的胸像特写。女歌手换为双手紧紧贴握麦克风，微闭双眼，红唇轻启，表情极具张力与沉浸感。夜风将她的发丝轻柔地拂过面颊，耳边的黑色耳返与银色环形耳环在光影中微微闪烁。背景中的高楼灯火逐渐虚化成梦幻自然的圆形焦外光斑（Bokeh）。\n\n【画面渲染与约束】\n真实皮肤纹理与面部微表情，风吹发丝符合自然物理惯性，推镜头全程无跳切无畸变，光影过渡细腻连贯，极高帧率流畅画质。", true, "adaptive", true, "all", false, 585528872, "randomize", false], "inputs": [{"name": "first_frame", "link": 17, "label": "first_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "first_frame"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "last_frame", "link": 18, "label": "last_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "last_frame"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "api_config", "label": "api_config", "type": "RH_OPENAPI_CONFIG", "localized_name": "api_config"}, {"widget": {"name": "resolution"}, "name": "resolution", "label": "resolution", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "resolution"}, {"widget": {"name": "duration"}, "name": "duration", "label": "duration", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "duration"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "shape": 7, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "generateAudio"}, "shape": 7, "name": "generateAudio", "label": "generateAudio", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "generateAudio"}, {"widget": {"name": "ratio"}, "shape": 7, "name": "ratio", "label": "ratio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "ratio"}, {"widget": {"name": "realPersonMode"}, "shape": 7, "name": "realPersonMode", "label": "realPersonMode", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "realPersonMode"}, {"widget": {"name": "conversionSlots"}, "shape": 7, "name": "conversionSlots", "label": "conversionSlots", "type": "COMBO", "loc